<item>
<title>杭州奥特曼遭巡警带走 天津“特朗普”难逃执法上海民众围警车要求放人据台媒报道，杭州一名cosplay“迪迦奥特曼”的民众</title>
<link>https://t.me/OutsightChina/10443</link>
<guid isPermaLink="true">https://t.me/OutsightChina/10443</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 15:01:23 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<div><div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto"><b>杭州奥特曼遭巡警带走 天津“特朗普”难逃执法</b><br/><b>上海民众围警车要求放人</b><br/><br/>据台媒报道，杭州一名cosplay“迪迦奥特曼”的民众10月30日被多名巡警带走，西安扮“大白”者也被警方带走，天津一名扮成美国总统特朗普者也“逃不过强力执法”。<br/><br/>据报导，上海复兴公园以“游乐场灯光设备检修调整”为由，万圣节前后夜间暂停部分游乐设施，周边大批警力驻守；据网友称，年轻人因声音稍大便遭开包检查、被要求当场换衣。据自媒体报道，10月31日，上海静安寺民众围住警车，集体要求警方释放因万圣节被抓的女孩。小红书上“万圣节+地名”词条均无法查看。<br/><br/>自2023年上海年轻人借“白纸”“大白”等装扮隐晦表达不满后，万圣节在中国就成了敏感节日；海外华文媒体引述网民留言：“鬼还没吓到人呢，却把权力先吓到了。”<br/><br/><a href="?q=%23%E6%94%BF%E6%B2%BB">#政治</a> <a href="?q=%23%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5">#审查</a> <a href="?q=%23%E5%B7%B2404">#已404</a> <a href="?q=%23%E7%9C%8B%E9%89%B4">#看鉴</a><br/><br/><i class="emoji" style="background-image:url('//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9497.png')"><b>🔗</b></i>原文链接<br/>《世界日报》<a href="https://udn.com/news/story/7335/9849802" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">多城管控万圣节！杭州奥特曼被带走 上海禁学生过洋节</a><br/>《民视新闻》<a href="https://www.ftvnews.com.tw/news/detail/2026B02I06M1" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">中国万圣节变“强力抓鬼节” 大动作执法！防疫大白、川普全被带走</a>）<br/>《联合报》<a href="https://udn.com/news/story/7332/9849847" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">万圣节大陆各地如临大敌 网友称：警察比民众还多</a><br/>“李老师不是你老师”<a href="https://x.com/whyyoutouzhele/status/2116577694066549162" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">X：上海静安寺民众围警车要求放人</a></div><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/ZqO6cyQHkFPh-y_gE5a0wcBERKib6iFC6QWlG0bRnG2Nbjx5RPwQ80X340ztPiCJfKKelL3LDqgtNCd-ZD8BIURg3EaHp48W4N7ScjBqHxEZ-mU4cHEP5AI0s8CLYkZEQrQcfVztXsF18LNlfXWN8w57D0oOBztqvJPjndUZp6xEabvxMbohI3KCsLcQ7swLl0iZ4Qfud1EF0HuBoGoipNTfe083Umt2W8aqqtqjUBWW8xTGzxzToj86PLOKbe0fDq_mRMjGFlPlrM0xLNunMiJXXVHk2d_JqB3womZyPppo05Evv7zRQ2-jyP8LcCxxWEcEqFor96BtTSxzbPseAw.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/pZJe89TdfF6n58M9dcFDeRfSe9zNlOamR9BzEkhdfltB5OpeNkwkRmoYJTGBn7eSmqQ86hIE9EDqn2218mrfTA7zoJFIPVS-LuZ1qepyc2hIzXNWFzWy5iocQzHYrAi3ksAmrk5WFtuZYkDtjyqVv3O4I4IAYkeyOCvGqn-_BhHjtwwrt3seUsOSYV82ItqHSpUcZkAPVHA3XgIwo6-p4yAp-Q4Qfgr6D43p8PCO6cRUeCFTj4--N8Q8HWzMFGij-KXiYOnLhUcHwUoouivWpl0FMAMsIBh3DwvVMcJ4GU8hXmB81nbmCNqPk3TttpwPuGILJnF4AAwbsX0iAX808Q.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/DaesKMrEyeBo1lpPgyYzRZGrNIYmTKJq0fAHYPOGyhow5oPXsskqnria_DZ3Sfwn1ReoNt66xb5IofpWOTtn9QgUXHmos10XS9yCtnnEWEGaB40NM04PCo5CaoyZmeKceMqK7mtguQ3Ad4ERBHX6f6AuvJhPvR6EtSHPzVBgDSw2WkPpMSPXNWdDrTjzdJ_-m8f4QvVrym1RuMG_2qQCzKvrpKC19Ev4x9o_jHyxxOflcPCMqm2he4EfoSH3KVRctaN0enra14gSt4lZKA3E6bexNwq4XCQGlpMlFxZwpe2Prz3YbRr3plkZe4E86X8_Q1eR73sER9Zlt1JR05MoTQ.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/v0m7kEuxMgILerZ4n3dd2UgS4Vwj_0Cb-C18bLABe6dl3w6QVdLB1_QY7frqreK2sDdcP2J8mSi4L1Vxvt5erh2VrqA4KdQpyyXDAGkyFNmAcz5UqMRL55gwFcyzKav4ehFzbdYkxYRIcY7ZU-USyju4fmCeocFjZsm2KtnJ4JWAEZrGrAA3mQEgtPgjPoXqfqeMuEG-RilsoEmYcwI7zNFWMYk5Y3swxOv2iQ64bhdIP7lUxM52LlZZZtbw19AiozOQRg1dnvFBq5iWJJ4EHGyIqQadBLJBoap_HLwTSjivBUXqTvDi_CVVaNgQNv2ZuaPcFN0_uXD6mEStHqF7gg.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9497.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09FA4AC.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9881.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/E29DA4.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><